le_i18n/jp","ベリル"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","恶作剧的好时候！"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/jp","悪戯日和だねえ！"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415648.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/jp","locales/jp/mn/herohub_story/10415648.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/jp","ベリル"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯！那座小城可是我精心准备了整整半个月的绝佳剧场！"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/jp","ちょっと、ラメンティス！僕が念入りに準備した最高の舞台に、なんてことをしてくれたんだ！"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415767.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/jp","locales/jp/mn/herohub_story/10415767.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔 & 拉曼提斯"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/jp","ベリル & ラメンティス"]]}